# Copy to  env.local.ps1  and edit if your venv / model caches don't live
# inside the repo folder (e.g. you put them on another drive because C: is full).
#
# $DataRoot is the folder that contains:  venv\  models\  whisper\  ollama\
#   hf\  pipcache\  tmp\
# The corpus + Chroma index always stay in the repo's  data\  (with the code);
# override $PipelineDataRoot below only if you want them elsewhere too.
# Leave a line out to keep env.ps1's default (repo folder / "ollama" on PATH).

# $DataRoot  = "D:\SIH26_env"
# $OllamaExe = "C:\Users\<you>\AppData\Local\Programs\Ollama\ollama.exe"
